d:" "\'=-read fn
l:0 1_´-1_'d

f:{(t;b):x
   t:"#"=""\-1_1_*t / target
   b:({@[x#0;y;:;1]}(#t))',/'"v"$'b / map buttons
   c:+!(#b)#2 / all combinations - pressing a button twice is back to start, so no need to check more than on and off in all permutations
   *^+/'c@&t~´2!'+/''+'c*`b} / multiply; mod 2 and match target - count num buttons, sort and return first (lowest)
